These standards apply on EVERY website, EVERY project, and EVERY session. No exceptions.

## Required skills

When creating or editing any page, route, blog post, service page, location page,
landing page, FAQ, metadata, UI copy, toast, error message, email, doc, or any
user-facing content:

1. **seo-geo-aeo-page-standards** - follow the skill and run its pre-publish checklist before finishing.
2. **no-em-dashes** - No webpage, post, etc should EVER contain em dashes whatsoever! Follow the skill and run its pre-publish check before finishing.

## Model selection

For non-trivial tasks, follow the **select-model** skill to pick the right model tier and mode.

## Before finishing any content work

- [ ] SEO / GEO / AEO pre-publish checklist complete
- [ ] Em dash scan clean on all changed paths
- [ ] No user-facing copy shipped without both checks passing
